          %ul
            %li
              %a{:href => "http://mathoverflow.net/a/20293/381"} MO discussion
              on the history of the idea of a space of ideals on which a ring is a ring of functions, both in analysis and in algebraic geometry
          %p For a general-abstract perspective:
